Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.02,0:00:10.34,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}Under the gentle sunlight, the chimes seem to pause.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.77,0:00:18.14,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}I breathe deeper as the wind brushes my cheeks.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.45,0:00:23.30,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}Those indirect tears, the tomorrow we named,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.30,0:00:27.48,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}And the criss-crossing lines stained future…
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.38,0:00:32.19,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}Let these innocent feelings
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.19,0:00:36.47,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}And our days of laughter
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.47,0:00:43.55,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}Become all the more precious to us.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.55,0:00:47.45,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}You showed me many new things,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.45,0:00:51.61,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}Crossing the fragmented moments.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.61,0:00:57.46,Kimi_no_Todoke_OP1-TL,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)}I want my feelings to join yours… to reach you…
