Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.66,0:01:07.67,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,No one really disliked me during elementary school,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:12.67,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,but I didn't have any close friends,\N didn't belong in a particular group, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.67,0:01:14.80,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Can I play?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.13,0:01:16.80,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, so you were here, Sawako-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.80,0:01:18.68,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, you can join in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.22,0:01:22.52,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,But one day, Shino, who was in the same class as me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.43,0:01:25.39,Default,Shino,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.44,0:01:28.73,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...accidentally got my name wrong, and ever since then...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.73,0:01:29.69,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,"Sadako"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:30.36,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.36,0:01:31.07,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.19,0:01:33.82,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...I've been assigned the role of "Sadako".
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:37.53,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1.2\fnAkbar\fs70\c&H000000&\t(2700,4000,\alpha&HFC&)\pos(960,385)}During Mi{\alpha&HFF&}ddle School
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.53,0:01:38.32,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1.2\fnAkbar\fs70\c&H252527&\alpha&H10&\t(\c&H2F3639&)\t(530,790,\alpha&HA0&)\pos(960,385)}During {\alpha&H40&\t(30,100,\alpha&H20&)\t(530,790,\alpha&HA0&)}Mi{\alpha&HFF&}ddle School
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:38.32,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1.2\fnAkbar\fs70\c&H000000&\pos(960,385)}{\alpha&HFF&}During Mi{\alpha&H00&\t(2700,4000,\alpha&HFC&)}ddle School
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.74,0:01:38.32,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,And the people I met in middle school thought it was funny to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.32,0:01:40.32,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako really seems like someone who can see ghosts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.32,0:01:42.74,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I wouldn't be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.74,0:01:44.29,Default,Guy3,0000,0000,0000,,She can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:47.33,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,And the next thing I knew, I was assigned\N the role of someone who could see ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.33,0:01:49.71,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1.2\fnAkbar\fs70\c&H000000&\t(2200,2380,\alpha&H20&)\pos(960,375)}Entering Hig{\alpha&FF&}h {\alpha&00&\t(2200,2380,\alpha&H20&)}School
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.33,0:01:50.84,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1.2\fnAkbar\fs70\c&H000000&\pos(960,375)}{\alpha&HFF&}Entering Hig{\alpha&H00&\t(2200,3500,\alpha&HFC&)}h{\alpha&HFF&} School
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.71,0:01:50.84,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1.2\fnAkbar\fs70\c&H000000&\alpha&H22&\t(\c&H323C5A&)\t(770,1130,\alpha&A0&)\pos(960,375)}Entering Hig{\alpha&HFF&}h School
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.71,0:01:50.84,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1.2\fnAkbar\fs70\c&H000000&\pos(960,375)}{\alpha&HFF&}Entering High {\alpha&H22&\t(\c&H386283&\alpha&H40&)}School
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.79,0:01:50.75,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,And after I entered high school...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.75,0:01:53.09,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I heard Sadako can see ghosts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:57.01,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,More importantly, I heard that if you stare into her eyes for more than three seconds, seven days later you'll be...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.34,0:02:01.51,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Each rumor led to another... I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.64,0:02:09.73,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Even then, now that I look back on it,\N I feel as though I've been blessed my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.27,0:02:15.23,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,There's been times when things would get me down,\N of course, but I don't think anything really made me sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:18.03,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:19.70,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Do you remember the rumors about Sadako?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:22.16,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, the thing about having Yano and Yoshida as her backups?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.24,0:02:25.54,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-It's all a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.83,0:02:30.17,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yano-san and Yoshida-san aren't backing me up or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:35.09,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.55,0:02:36.80,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,We get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.42,0:02:41.93,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,The criminal delinquent and the whore, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.93,0:02:51.90,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnCrayonAL\fs120\c&HF1F1FA&\1a&11&\pos(960,770)}friends
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.93,0:02:51.90,Kimi-Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnCrayonAL\fs120\b1\blur4\c&H605E85&\pos(968,778)}friends
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:51.10,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Morning, Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.10,0:02:51.90,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.11,0:02:54.44,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Morning, Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.44,0:02:55.86,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.65,0:02:58.44,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.44,0:03:00.07,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,That's the girl's bathroom they're crowding around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.07,0:03:01.61,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:03.57,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yo, Kazehaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.57,0:03:05.45,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, there's a fight inside the girl's bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:06.99,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,A fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:09.16,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,And guess who's fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:11.17,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako and girls from Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:13.83,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Kuronuma?! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.21,0:03:16.84,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,We were in there a little while ago, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:19.84,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,It seemed like Sadako was the one who started the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:22.18,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Something about Chizu and Yano-chin's rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:23.68,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:25.14,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you mean the one about her beating up an old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.14,0:03:26.85,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,The thing about Yano being with a hundred guys, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.31,0:03:30.48,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I heard Sadako's the one who's been spreading them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.98,0:03:32.06,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,How...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.23,0:03:36.36,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to try my best to become friends with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:39.36,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,How could you possibly think she's the one behind that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.61,0:03:43.32,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,What are you yelling for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.32,0:03:44.57,Default,Yano,0000,0000,0000,,What's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.95,0:03:47.49,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Kuronuma's fighting hard for you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.91,0:03:50.79,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,It's about those rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:54.54,Default,Yano,0000,0000,0000,,Let us through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:55.58,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Move it! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:04:00.17,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Are you holding something back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.17,0:04:02.38,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.22,0:04:06.39,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,But... I can't be the one to settle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.89,0:04:09.22,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,They have to do it, or else it wouldn't mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.39,0:04:13.48,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Hang in there, Kuronuma...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.73,0:04:15.69,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Hang in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.77,0:04:17.77,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Hang in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.61,0:04:22.36,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Please take back what you said earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.99,0:04:24.99,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What's this hand for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:26.03,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.03,0:04:27.58,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,You've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:30.24,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,What you said isn't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:32.62,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Did you hear that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.87,0:04:37.54,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yano-san and Yoshida-san aren't like that at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:44.76,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,You'll hurt their feelings if you say things like that about them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.63,0:04:47.26,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You're not one to talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:52.73,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,"They're nice"? "Their feelings will get hurt"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:54.19,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I'm surprised you have the guts to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:59.52,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you the one who started all the rumors about\N Yoshida being a delinquent and Yano being a whore?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.86,0:05:01.90,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:04.53,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,W-Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:06.36,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Like I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:10.41,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You're the one who's spreading all the bad rumors about those two, Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:13.37,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,M-Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:16.83,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I think she just got knocked over!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.83,0:05:18.79,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,I-I think we should go and stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.05,0:05:22.25,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Leave this to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:28.55,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,W-Why would I ever say something bad about them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.55,0:05:29.76,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It's a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.76,0:05:33.64,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing bad about them. They've only been kind to me-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:37.19,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You see, we don't really care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.02,0:05:40.56,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,We want to talk it out with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:44.24,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'm pretty sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.49,0:05:47.99,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,...those two started hanging out with you just for fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:50.49,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,...but I think they're bored with you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:52.83,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,The same goes for you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:59.75,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You got close to them for Kazehaya, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.17,0:06:03.25,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,And that's why you don't need them anymore, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.71,0:06:05.42,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You're such an eyesore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.92,0:06:08.76,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you be a good girl and stay away from everyone again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:12.68,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,If you do that, we promise to leave you alone-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.93,0:06:14.18,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,That's not it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:23.69,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care whether you leave me alone or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.23,0:06:26.69,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,So... please. Take back what you said earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.69,0:06:27.65,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:28.40,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell are you-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.40,0:06:29.28,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.91,0:06:31.28,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Everything you said is a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.87,0:06:34.66,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,All of you don't understand anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.24,0:06:36.50,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,All of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:40.00,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.17,0:06:45.88,Default,Yano,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad your efforts were rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.84,0:06:49.47,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Even though everyone else avoided me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:51.64,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Here, drink up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.05,0:06:56.39,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...they were so kind to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:06:58.81,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You're drenched!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.81,0:06:59.64,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Here, wear this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.64,0:07:00.73,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,That smells...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:06.23,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...without being afraid of me... without avoiding me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.32,0:07:10.36,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,You... don't know any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.99,0:07:16.54,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,You don't know how much I like...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.33,0:07:19.29,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...no, more than like...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:21.29,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...how much I love those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.21,0:07:24.25,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:28.05,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,R-Rather than "like"...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:31.97,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Rather than saying I "like" you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:33.93,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...I'd say...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.39,0:07:42.81,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I love you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.69,0:07:45.73,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.67,0:08:04.29,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yoshida!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.29,0:08:08.05,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to stand up for her\N even after all those rumors she started?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.42,0:08:09.84,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:12.30,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way she'd do something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.97,0:08:15.30,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell are you-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:18.47,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,That's what we think, so everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.47,0:08:20.39,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Now run along.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.39,0:08:22.27,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,W-What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:24.02,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You guys don't have anything to do with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:26.11,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I just have something to say to Sadako-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:30.65,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You think you can beat me in a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.65,0:08:33.90,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,We went to the same middle\N school, so you've heard the story, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.90,0:08:37.87,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Ninety-nine wins in a row for one-on-one fights against the guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.87,0:08:40.08,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:44.62,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,If you lay a finger on Sadako again,\N I won't let you off with just a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.25,0:08:48.96,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,F-Fine! Whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.96,0:08:50.00,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:51.88,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.88,0:08:55.30,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Really, everything you said is just a misunderstanding...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:08:57.39,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Geez, you're so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:08:59.01,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.01,0:09:00.51,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:02.27,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Happy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.44,0:09:09.36,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She... understands now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.69,0:09:14.99,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yano-san! Yoshida-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:16.99,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,They understand now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.53,0:09:21.49,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,They really do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.37,0:09:24.83,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,They realized none of the rumors were true!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.58,0:09:27.37,Default,Yano,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine, Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.54,0:09:30.71,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,We don't really care about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:35.97,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.97,0:09:37.93,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way she'd do something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.68,0:09:41.60,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yano-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.93,0:09:43.43,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshida-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.81,0:09:46.60,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.27,0:09:54.32,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you... for believing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:10:00.53,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,K-Kazehaya, did we... happen to make you mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.53,0:10:02.12,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:03.79,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You totally are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:05.45,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.83,0:10:14.30,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,...hate it when people spread trashy rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.34,0:10:21.60,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,You all should have known those\N rumors about Yano and Yoshida were fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:24.93,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Did you honestly think Kuronuma would start something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.85,0:10:27.31,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Well, umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:30.44,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,We don't know much about Kuronuma, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:34.78,Default,Guy3,0000,0000,0000,,Since it became such a big thing,\N I started to believe that Sadako really did start it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:37.65,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako was standing up for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:39.11,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Standing up for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.11,0:10:43.91,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Even after those girls knocked her down,\N she kept sticking up for Yano-san and Yoshida-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.91,0:10:46.91,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,We... couldn't do anything for her...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.41,0:10:51.50,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,But... Yano-san and Yoshida-san saved her instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.79,0:10:55.75,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yano and Yoshida really came to her rescue?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.75,0:10:56.63,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.05,0:11:01.89,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Which means... it {\i1}was{\i0\fscx30} {\r} a lie that\N Sadako was the one spreading the rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.89,0:11:03.60,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, so it wasn't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:05.47,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it was strange from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.47,0:11:07.93,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Changing the topic here, but weren't her notes amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:11.85,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! I aced yesterday's test because of her notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.85,0:11:13.06,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.06,0:11:15.23,Default,Guy3,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako is really amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.23,0:11:18.07,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I kinda figured the whole thing was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:20.78,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Kuronuma would love to hear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.78,0:11:23.03,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,It's thanks to you two, Hirano and Endou.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.83,0:11:27.49,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Good job, Hirano, Endou!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.83,0:11:31.75,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,You can do it, Kuronuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:37.34,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I'd be able to clear up the misunderstandings on my own...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.84,0:11:39.01,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.67,0:11:44.76,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I've... always believed there wasn't anything that could be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:49.27,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,"I messed up again. Oh well."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:52.48,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Even though I really wanted to get along with everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.52,0:11:56.44,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,in my heart, a part of me had already given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.44,0:11:58.65,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.94,0:12:03.07,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I just couldn't give you two up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:12.16,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I knew that more rumors would spring up if I stayed by your\N side, and that those rumors would end up hurting you two again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.58,0:12:17.34,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,But even then, I just couldn't find it in me to let you two go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:26.68,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I... didn't know how to cheer you\N two up when you were feeling down...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.01,0:12:27.93,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:31.10,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I... want to be with you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.64,0:12:35.10,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Just like how we are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.52,0:12:36.19,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:40.19,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I want to be closer to you two than we are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.03,0:12:47.99,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,If misunderstandings do spring up again, I'll try\N my best to clear them up, no matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:52.41,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm... being really selfish right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.41,0:12:59.59,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Despite that, they're still listening to me... without looking away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:07.09,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I... I want to become...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:10.35,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I want to become friends with you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.60,0:13:17.77,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.77,0:13:18.65,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.27,0:13:21.98,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You thought we were hurt because of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:27.41,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You thought that if you were with us, you'd end up hurting us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.28,0:13:33.79,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,But even then, you wanted to be with us...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.66,0:13:40.21,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako... that's what you were hurt over?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.63,0:13:45.38,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yano-san, I-I'm dirty from falling down earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:45.38,Default-alt,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.35,0:13:51.64,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You're such an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.39,0:13:59.06,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Geez... you already answered all the questions I've been meaning to ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:04.86,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm ashamed for doubting you even for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:07.53,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.20,0:14:10.66,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Please, don't get used to being alone again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.58,0:14:12.83,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:17.12,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,We care about you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.96,0:14:19.12,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.83,0:14:21.08,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You don't ask to become friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.34,0:14:23.84,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,When you actually realize it, you're already friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.46,0:14:29.30,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,We've been friends all along, Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.72,0:14:31.14,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.01,0:14:35.43,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,We were already friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.39,0:14:40.02,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.31,0:14:43.07,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Let's all hug to show our love for each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.07,0:14:46.07,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Stop saying things that'd create more misunderstandings!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.07,0:14:48.28,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to start more rumors!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.53,0:14:51.28,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Geez, you cry too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:52.16,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:54.33,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You're tearing up, too, Yano-chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.24,0:14:57.25,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:05.25,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I memorized a ghost story, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.80,0:15:14.72,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,My... very first friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:20.89,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I think she's cracking up while crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.89,0:15:23.27,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,But they really do look friendly with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.27,0:15:24.52,Default,Girl3,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.52,0:15:25.19,Default,Girl4,0000,0000,0000,,It's a little scary to watch...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.49,0:15:29.90,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(340,0)}Sign: Reconciled
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.78,0:15:29.90,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Reconciled!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:33.91,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,The cast changed halfway through the\N show, and everything ended happily ever after!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.78,0:15:33.91,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(380,0)}Sign: Reconciled
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:35.74,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.16,0:15:38.87,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess I don't have to cheer her up anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.13,0:15:45.38,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,A fight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.38,0:15:47.13,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Where's the fight at?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.13,0:15:48.88,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:15:57.01,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.01,0:15:58.35,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Can we help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.35,0:16:00.31,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,We're kind of in the middle of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:03.19,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell is with this air of youth floating around?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:04.73,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not interested in this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.73,0:16:06.77,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Start punching each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.07,0:16:09.32,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,And you call yourself a teacher?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.07,0:16:11.28,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:11.99,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.99,0:16:13.07,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:15.03,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.03,0:16:16.78,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Scatter like ants!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:24.37,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Pin totally ruined the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.92,0:16:30.51,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:33.80,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Good for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.51,0:16:38.56,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Your words... echoed in my mind the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.43,0:16:40.56,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:43.89,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,"Hang in there... Hang in there..."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:46.23,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I could hear you the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.77,0:16:50.44,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Kazehaya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.74,0:16:53.32,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Sadako was...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.32,0:16:54.78,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,...smiling just now, wasn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:56.66,Default,Guy3,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:09.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Then, the exam period ended,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:12.80,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1000)}Sign: Kuronuma Sawako
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.21,0:17:13.63,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,and I noticed that my grades had dropped quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:16.13,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,No way! Sadako only came in thirtieth?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.13,0:17:18.30,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,That's still really good, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.30,0:17:21.47,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I did really bad on the first day...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.47,0:17:25.77,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,For some reason, our class average went up dramatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.47,0:17:23.56,Default-alt,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have to take make up tests!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.56,0:17:24.52,Default-alt,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.52,0:17:25.77,Default-alt,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Me neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.77,0:17:27.98,Default,Guy3,0000,0000,0000,,It's all thanks to Sadako's notes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:29.90,Default,All,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.90,0:17:34.90,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(960,0)}Sign: Zashiki Warashi
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.61,0:17:31.98,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Zashiki Warashi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.98,0:17:33.53,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Zashiki Warashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.53,0:17:34.90,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako Warashi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.57,0:17:43.20,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Somehow, it feels like people are looking at me differently now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.20,0:17:44.75,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,These days, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.41,0:17:49.92,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder... if I was able to give it my best?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.88,0:17:54.01,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako, let's go get some ramen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:56.80,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,M-Me? I can come along, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.80,0:18:00.30,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah, you haven't told us your ghost story yet, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:02.76,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! I really want you to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:04.56,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Please, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:07.35,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako, do you have money on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.35,0:18:08.69,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Not much, but yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:09.69,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You should be fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.07,0:18:15.82,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,There won't be many opportunities for me to be alone with her now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.82,0:18:19.45,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya, let's hang out today!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:20.66,Default-alt,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while since I've had ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:27.12,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I feel like I've been reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.87,0:18:31.04,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,And it all started when I met you, Kazehaya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.04,0:18:34.25,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,N-No fair...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.96,0:18:36.63,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Kazehaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:41.22,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Did you know? Friends go out to eat ramen together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.09,0:18:42.26,Default-alt,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I've met people who have become really important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:42.51,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.51,0:18:44.10,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,She's just pulling your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.35,0:18:47.52,Default-alt,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,{\move(960,960,960,1030,750,1150)}I was able to do things I never could have done on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.56,0:18:54.23,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I can't help but let those two have the spotlight for a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.36,0:19:00.53,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,...after you showed me such a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.33,0:19:04.95,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.95,0:19:06.33,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.33,0:19:07.08,Default,Guy3,0000,0000,0000,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:08.04,Default,Guy4,0000,0000,0000,,Want me to take you to the nurse's office?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.83,0:19:11.25,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Is that you, Sadako?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:14.88,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,That girl from before...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.71,0:19:16.96,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so happy for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:19.17,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Your dearest wish came true!\N You were able to become friends with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.63,0:19:21.72,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.26,0:19:23.68,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.06,0:19:27.81,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Please take good care of Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.10,0:19:31.69,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.61,0:19:36.48,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I made sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.23,0:19:39.86,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.65,0:19:42.70,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,So if you don't like us...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:45.16,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,...how do you feel about us again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.29,0:19:49.20,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.20,0:19:50.46,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.21,0:19:56.38,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I really love you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:19:57.96,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.96,0:19:59.84,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,So you love us, Sawako.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.84,0:20:00.76,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Sawako!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.26,0:20:09.35,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,So many things have changed since I met Kazehaya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.93,0:20:14.10,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I've... experienced so many new feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:16.90,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah! Tell us the ghost story already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:18.57,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,F-Fine, I'll listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.57,0:20:19.44,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.44,0:20:20.19,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,H-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.19,0:20:23.15,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,"Hoichi was an expert at the biwa..."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.15,0:20:25.12,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Your "ghost story" is Hoichi the Earless?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:30.04,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya-san looked really mad back then, didn't he...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.04,0:20:31.16,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.16,0:20:33.62,Default,Girl3,0000,0000,0000,,He said that he hates it when people spread trashy rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:37.63,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,He... was talking about us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.42,0:20:41.17,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if she's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.17,0:20:42.09,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.97,0:20:47.97,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yuka has been head over heels for\N Kazehaya ever since middle school...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:00.23,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Wait up!
